Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:07.11,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:08.46,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:09.36,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.61,Default,Kid 1,0,0,0,,You really went to a desert island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:14.00,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Two hundred thousand views?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:15.03,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\an7\fs20\c&H3C3F3C&\3c&HF9FDFA&}*NO ESCAPE* 1 Week Desert Island Survival\N{\c&HF9FDFA&\3c&HE863DC&}200k views   {\c&HBDB5B4&\3c&HF9FDFA&}1 week ago   {\c&H323532&}...more\NMayonaka Punch\N{\c&HF9FDFA&\3c&HE863DC&}30k {\c&HBDB5B4&\3c&HF9FDFA&}subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.03,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Wowie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.91,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's nothing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:20.14,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:23.90,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What kind of videos are you all watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:25.17,Default,Kid 3,0,0,0,,This one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:27.13,Default,Kid 3,0,0,0,,We're doing this for music class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.90,Default,Kid 3,0,0,0,,We're practicing as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:31.09,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Teamwork is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.11,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,We need to all be in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:35.56,Default,Yu's Mother,0,0,0,,Yu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.63,Default,Kid 1,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.90,Default,Kid 2,0,0,0,,I should be heading home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.38,Default,Kid 3,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:43.85,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.07,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:44.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So it's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:48.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, it's just an old office building.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:49.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is this {\i1}really{\i0} the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:53.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:54.53,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:55.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.28,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H172BC3&\3c&H2EA0E0&\pos(318.5,50.5)}Caution\N{\c&HA3EAFC&}Watch Your Fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:09.79,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H845334&\t(21,772,\3c&H18120E&)}Ichiko's Wish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.64,DefaultItalicsTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,At around seven o'clock this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:12.92,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord2\c&H222523&\3c&HF5F6F3&\pos(320,242)}Sudden House Collapse Remains Mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:15.92,DefaultItalicsTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,there was an explosion of unknown \Norigin in this quiet neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:28.43,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs16\c&H373A37&\3c&HF4F6F5&\pos(157,49)}Nearby Residents Concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:28.43,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs16\c&H373A37&\3c&HF4F6F5&\pos(527,75)}Lives in Vicinity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.42,DefaultHigh,Tokage,0,0,0,,Man, it just suddenly collapsed \Nand scared me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.93,DefaultHigh,Tokage,0,0,0,,The cause? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.55,DefaultHigh,Tokage,0,0,0,,Maybe a gigantic bat or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:28.31,DefaultHigh,Tokage,0,0,0,,Or maybe a goddess came bursting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:32.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord2\c&H222523&\3c&HF5F6F3&}Sudden House Collapse Remains Mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:32.70,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0,0,0,,As you can see, local residents \Ncontinue to offer cryptic comments...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:37.23,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Do you know why you were \Nsummoned here to home base?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:38.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,About what happened at Banpai Manor...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:44.41,Default,Group,0,0,0,,We're terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:52.07,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,So Mother's behind that curtain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.25,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I can't make her out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.17,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We've allowed you to make videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:00.01,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,But I believe we said \Nnot to cause any commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:01.51,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:03.63,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So how did this come about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.14,Flashback,Tokage,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:18.66,Flashback,Tokage,0,0,0,,Enjoying the drinks I bought \Nwith my gambling winnings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:19.90,Flashback,Group,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:22.65,Flashback,Tokage,0,0,0,,Toss me up in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:25.16,Flashback,Group,0,0,0,,And a one! And a two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.82,Flashback,Group,0,0,0,,And a three!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:33.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:34.79,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:37.17,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Banpai Manor will be demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.17,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.84,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,D-Demolished?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,On Mother's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:47.08,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You wrecked Banpai Manor, \Nattracted the public's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:51.18,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,and risked humans discovering \Nthe existence of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.56,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's only natural that \Nyou'd be punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.69,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're a bunch of bad oranges!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.70,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Or so Mother says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:02.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's she mean by bad oranges? \NIs that a proverb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:04.02,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, there's an old TV drama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:04.61,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:05.45,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Cut the chatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:07.20,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,So sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:11.20,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,If you tear down Banpai Manor, where do {\i1}we{\i0} go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.46,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You'll be moved to a different house \Nwhere we keep troublemakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:16.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:18.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What about {\i1}me{\i0}, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't care. Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:22.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's hard to shoot videos \Nunless we live together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:27.72,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What happens to your videos \Nis none of my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:29.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki needs to be with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:32.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:36.48,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'd be scared living with \Nvampires I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:38.52,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm also opposed to moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:42.54,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The local pachinko parlor is the only one \Nthat has Ichijo-kun to tune the pins for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:43.98,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I don't want that, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:47.07,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I really don't want to lose Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:49.70,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You have no room to complain \Nafter all the trouble you've caused!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:52.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I haven't caused {\i1}any{\i0} trouble here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.99,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,And who was the one \Nwho racked up all that debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's not our fault the wall got wrecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The alcohol's to blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.96,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,After all that's happened, \Nyou're really blaming the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,They say, "Condemn the crime, \Nnot the criminal!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I apologize for what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It was all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:16.27,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.21,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:28.92,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't go causing any more headaches for Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.12,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:39.37,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Let's go ask them again \Nnot to demolish our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:43.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Still, you know, they said \Nwe could keep shooting videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:46.04,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Maybe moving isn't such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Or, heck, maybe it's a great one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:49.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Weren't you against it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.28,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:55.56,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs20\pos(320,60)\3c&H2C82E7&}Things to Check Before Living Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:55.56,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&HAAF7F4&\u1\pos(320,123.5)}What's the best room layout for two people?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.93,0:06:55.56,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&H717472&\pos(320,123.5)}What's the best room layout for two people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:55.56,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs18\frz9.68\pos(309.5,189)\c&H6199E6&\3c&HD8F3EB&}What to consider\N\N\N\N\N\N\Nwhen renting to share
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.71,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,"The best room layout for two people"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.56,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're going to live with {\i1}Masaki?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:58.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:02.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm going to have Masaki \Nteach me how to edit videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:06.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And to do that, I'll need to spend time \Nover at her place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:11.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So we might gradually end up \Nliving together, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:14.20,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,In other words, as long as \Nyou can be alone with Masaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:16.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,you don't need Banpai Manor anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.37,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I don't think it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.66,0:07:23.95,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You too, Fu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:26.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We can't go against Mother's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:31.12,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm fine wherever I end up going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:32.89,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,So long as I can gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.25,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I came to a realization.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:39.39,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,No matter where I end up moving, \NI can just fly on over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:41.64,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one who wrecked the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:44.27,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I-I'm not the only one to blame here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:45.58,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.52,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Everyone else except me is at fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:53.45,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But I'm the only one taking the \Nfuture of Banpai Manor seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.84,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:57.20,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Did you just call me a pain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:08:00.90,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You're the only one who cares \Nso much about Banpai Manor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:01.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.58,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can't tell her the truth like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.83,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please say it a little nicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:08.43,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I mean, let's be honest. It's a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.81,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You all agree with me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Is that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I get it! I'm nothing but a bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So be it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'll take care of everything all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I-Ichiko, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:23.28,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly calm! Cool as a cucumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:25.42,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Well, I'm leaving, since I'm out of balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.10,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I need to go to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I can't believe it slipped my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:34.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't know how to play pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.11,Default,Pachinko Employee,0,0,0,,Children shouldn't be playing pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:47.50,Default,Pachinko Employee,0,0,0,,How old are you, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A hundred and ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:56.09,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,They just don't understand \Nhow precious Banpai Manor is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:58.84,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Well, they'll come back crying in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:01.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I won't hold it against them when they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.39,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Since I'm a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:07.05,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,If we all eat a meal together \Nwith everyone's favorite food in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:09.29,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll all see the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:11.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:15.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Vampires can subsist on blood alone, \Nso why do you eat food?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.95,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's because I suggested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:20.04,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Eating meals together, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.62,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I was originally a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:28.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,so before I came here, I'd eat dinner \Nwith my mom, my dad, and my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So if a vampire drinks my blood, \Nwill I turn into one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.46,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's not an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:40.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Besides, I drank your blood already, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:43.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:44.93,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's actually the reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:49.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Humans turn into vampires when \Nvampire blood enters their body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then why'd you become a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:54.92,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I can't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:55.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:10:00.83,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'd love to have stayed a human, \Nliving with the rest of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But I was turned into a vampire \Nwith no warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.54,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mother keeps them in check nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:10.70,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,but in the past, vampires went around turning\Nhumans into vampires against their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:17.70,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And so, I lost my humanity, \Nwith nowhere to return and nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:23.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Spending all my time alone, \Nwalking and walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:27.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It was then that I stumbled \Nupon Banpai Manor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:37.38,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,and Live-sama welcomed me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.77,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I knew I could survive without eating food,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:43.74,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,but I wanted to eat with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,so I always cooked for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:54.00,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Day after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:58.72,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,after day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,until Live-sama sat at the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:07.89,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And Tokage as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.38,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,followed by Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:20.28,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ever since, we've always eaten \Ntogether at Banpai Manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:24.03,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's why Banpai Manor \Nis the home that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:29.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That story was heavier than I thought, \Nand now my chest hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:32.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Also, why hot pot in the summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:36.47,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Because we can put everyone's \Nfavorite foods in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:53.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:53.06,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:56.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's eat, let's eat, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We'll eat when everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.58,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.12,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,L-Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:14.33,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Don't sneak up on me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:18.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let me take a quick peek inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why hot pot on a hot day like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:26.36,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So this is where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.02,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:32.00,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What's with the get-up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm going to talk it out in person with Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.48,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Since none of you are any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're gonna go in there armed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're totally ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:43.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:46.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't care what someone who \Ncan't stick up for a friend has to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm real hungry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:54.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This house is important to her, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You should be the first ones \Nto sympathize with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We can finally eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:10.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko, time for some grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.68,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Make sure there's liver in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:15.39,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, crown daisy leaves too, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.77,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got enoki mushrooms as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:20.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, save some for the rest of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're recording this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:24.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hot pot in summer might \Nmake for a funny video.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:30.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Meals really are best eaten \Nwith everyone... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:31.71,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:35.56,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Time to eat—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:36.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What's with your manners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Why did you come in through the wall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:40.68,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We have a front door!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:44.17,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Also, you need to wash \Nyour hands before you eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:47.28,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Huh? You're really getting angry {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:52.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start the \NDon't Demolish Banpai Manor Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What exactly does that involve?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Are we storming the place with garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:59.31,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,If we do that, we'll be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:02.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,To be honest, pleading with her \Nwill get us nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:07.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Maybe we'd have more of a chance if \Nwe showed her how much we've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.47,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Grown? I'm growing every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.20,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:17.07,Flashback,Kid 3,0,0,0,,We're doing this for music class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:18.93,Flashback,Kid 3,0,0,0,,We're practicing as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:21.15,Flashback,Kid 2,0,0,0,,Teamwork is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:22.96,Flashback,Kid 2,0,0,0,,We need to all be in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:26.17,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:28.34,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:29.96,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:34.88,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,If we can pull this off, I'm sure \NMother will change her mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:58.20,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H232436&\3c&H62A9D1&}Karate Dojo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:13.22,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You'll be in for it if you waste \NMother's time on something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:14.81,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:17.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs11\pos(320,174)\3c&HDDB95F&}Join a Meeting\N\N\N\N\N\N{\c&H777777&\3c&HFBFEFB&}Sign Up\N\N\N\N\NSign In
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.85,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,N-Now's my chance to see Mother's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:21.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs11\3c&HDDB95F&\pos(320,138.5)}Join with Computer Audio\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\c&H777777&\3c&HFBFEFB&}Test Speaker and Microphone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:24.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs36\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(320,92)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.11,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,O-Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.90,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,1)\blur0.2\fs20\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(317.5,260)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.90,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.41,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs14\\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\frz3.89\fax0.1\pos(327.5,311.5)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,In our time living at Banpai Manor,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:46.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,we've slowly learned to cooperate, \Nand we continue to grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.54,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs40\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(320,92)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:51.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're not bad oranges!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.55,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And we're about to prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:54.82,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.31,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And in the case that we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:16:01.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,we ask you to cancel \Nthe demolition of Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:02.19,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:27.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs13\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\frz8.036\fax0.05\pos(253.5,287)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:33.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,As you can see, our hearts \Nare perfectly joined as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:40.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,As such, continuing to live together \Nshould pose no problem. Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:44.66,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.42,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Like hell I'd say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:49.58,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Who do you take me for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.25,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That wasn't enough to melt your heart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:54.96,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:56.46,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I apologize, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:58.13,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It ended up being a waste of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Banpai Manor will, as planned—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:00.64,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:00.64,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.91,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Don't demolish Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:04.70,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,After all that, you still won't give up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.34,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:07.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.90,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't be so childish! You're being a bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:20.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:25.31,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,After I stopped being human,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:28.02,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I was alone all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:34.75,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But they ate dinner with me like I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,They all did,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:40.80,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,even though they don't need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:43.74,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It was my own childish demand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:48.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,but they've put up with it all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:54.97,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So I've always been a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:19:01.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama. Tokage. Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:21.05,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,224)\blur0.2\fs30\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\frz6.179\fax-0.03\pos(355,202)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:21.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look at this video!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.41,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:23.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:24.34,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.46,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:27.95,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,A little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:28.88,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:31.88,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,You really love making us \Nwork our socks off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.77,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,That meat is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:37.14,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,They may all be pieces of garbage, \Nworse than rotten orange peels...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:38.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,She never went that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:43.03,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(22,4485,\fscx120.98\fscy120.98)\blur0.2\fs23\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\fax0.08\frz2.516\move(323,154,326.4,146.83,22,4485)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:43.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They only care about themselves, never \Nagree on anything, and are totally useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:46.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But here they are, \Nsitting down for dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not because they were forced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:50.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're acting out of compassion for Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:57.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,they're the kind of people who \Ncan think about others, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:59.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs22\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\frz3.519\fax-0.03\pos(341.5,136)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:19:59.29,DefaultItalics,Mother,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:02.30,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You can't be the only ones \Nwho get special treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:04.84,DefaultItalicsTop,Mother,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:08.33,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If we turned a blind eye to\N all the trouble you've caused
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:11.56,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,it would set a bad example \Nfor the rest of the vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're not troublemakers anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.56,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then just what {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:18.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:19.15,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.18,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:23.70,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We're doing our best to make videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:24.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:25.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So what if—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:27.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And they're all growing as time goes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.37,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.42,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,So what—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:34.50,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,A-At first, I thought, "Why videos? Why me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.61,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But now I enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.15,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Like I said, so what—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.59,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.38,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sure, we've still got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:46.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,One day, we'll become NewTubers \Nwith over a million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:49.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll become so big, \Nthere'll be no room for complaints!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:55.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So let us live together, here in Banpai Manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:56.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Pretty please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.06,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Pretty please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:20:59.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:01.65,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs22\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\fax-0.05\pos(330,119.5)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:11.16,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs36\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(320,92)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.16,DefaultItalics,Mother,0,0,0,,Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:12.41,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:15.75,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(27,3322,\fscx107.06\fscy107.06)\blur0.2\fs36\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\move(320,92,319.23,86.09,27,3322)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:14.91,DefaultItalics,Mother,0,0,0,,A million subscribers in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:18.42,DefaultItalics,Mother,0,0,0,,Reach that number, \Nand I'll call off the demolition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:18.42,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx107.06\fscy107.06\blur0.2\fs36\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(319.23,86.09)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:19.50,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,H-Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Six months is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Give us a year, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs36\fnArial Black\c&HB2F3FE&\pos(320,92)}Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.2\fs10\fnArial\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H1E0E74&\pos(567,310)}End Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.89,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,We only have a little over\N twenty thousand right now... so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:30.14,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\c&H777777&\pos(491.5,314)}Mother has left the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.40,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,She hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A million subs in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:36.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,To be honest, that'll be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:38.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:41.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch has no choice but to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:45.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For Masaki's blood and for Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:45.58,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.21,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:46.21,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:51.41,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, all together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Ichiko\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HE6FEE4&\3c&H73D076&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:26.17,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&HA54EEB&\3c&HA54EEB&\pos(320,95)}We're Breaking Up
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.55,0:23:26.17,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&HA54EEB&\3c&HF9FAF5&\pos(320,95)}We're Breaking Up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:27.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,How do we get a million subs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:29.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Let's just borrow some money \Nand give it all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.01,0:23:29.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ichiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:30.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Y-Yuki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.21,0:23:30.83,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,More debts?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.83,0:23:31.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I-I'm just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:32.35,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,More debts?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.35,0:23:34.30,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,K-Kidding... Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:37.43,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Your Faves Are Adorbs, \NHit That Subscribe"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.43,0:23:37.43,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2B282A&}Your Faves Are Adorbs, Hit That Subscribe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.43,0:23:39.18,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Make sure you support me as well.
